     _n_e_t_i_s_r___h_a_n_d_l_e_r___t _n_h___h_a_n_d_l_e_r  Protocol handler function that will be in‐
                                  voked on each packet received for the proto‐
                                  col.

     _n_e_t_i_s_r___m_2_f_l_o_w___t _n_h___m_2_f_l_o_w    Optional protocol function to generate a
